WEBVTT

00:10:26.818 --> 00:10:30.908
who has had to learn way more
about crying than he ever wanted to,

00:10:30.932 --> 00:10:32.532
he doesn't run away.

00:10:32.892 --> 00:10:35.408
He'll ask me why I'm crying,

00:10:35.432 --> 00:10:38.332
and I'll let him know
I just need my release.

00:10:39.226 --> 00:10:41.228
He'll take my hand,

00:10:42.236 --> 00:10:43.539
and you know what I'll do?

00:10:43.563 --> 00:10:45.243
I will let it all out.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:53.680
And then I'm going to sink
into that deep sense of intimacy

00:10:53.704 --> 00:10:57.069
and extraordinary sense of relief

00:10:57.093 --> 00:11:00.063
that only my tears can bring.